# Shared UI components (RFC-026 · RFC-095)

Extract **presentation** into `shared/foundation/` (`primitives/` atoms, `components/` composers); keep **state, fetching, navigation** in feature screens. No peer `shared/widgets/` package.

**Design alone / data alone:** `components/` widgets must not import `features/**` or take feature god objects (`IptvController`, …). Pass display fields + callbacks. Features adapt.

## Folder map

```
shared/foundation/components/hero/            # titles, meta, cinematic hero, overview, banner
shared/foundation/components/media_details/   # details page, cast/trailers, torrent sources, episodes
shared/foundation/components/posters/         # rows, posters, atmosphere, loading skeleton
shared/foundation/components/rows|cards|chrome/  # kit section / poster / search / portals chip
shared/foundation/components/details/         # kit details chrome / play / sources
shared/foundation/components/panel/           # sources panel, side overlay, portal list shell
shared/foundation/primitives/chrome/          # focusable tap, scroller, overlays, mood chip
shared/foundation/primitives/desktop/         # window chrome / focus / geometry
shared/foundation/primitives/tv/              # browse text field, search overlay
shared/foundation/components/update/          # update dialog + progress banner
shared/foundation/components/packs/           # pack choice cards, install progress
shared/foundation/primitives/brand/           # logo, splash logo, profile avatar
shared/foundation/components/playback/        # stream/torrent loading, resolve failure
shared/foundation/components/chrome/          # kit search page/filters, recent queries/tile, letter jump, status pin, portals chip
shared/foundation/components/account/         # keychain consent
```

Barrel: `media_details/media_details.dart` for details + torrent sources.

## When to extract

| Signal | Action |
|--------|--------|
| Same widget in torrent + streaming details | `media_details/` |
| Same widget in Home hero + details hero | `hero/` |
| Screen-only logic (search, Trakt, gen-token) | Stay in `details_screen.dart` |
| Panel UI vs panel state | Panel widget gets data + callbacks; screen owns `_selectedSourceId`, fetch |

## Media details page shape

Both details screens use:

```dart
MediaDetailsScrollPage(
  hero: MediaDetailsHero(...),
  backdropUrl: ...,
  backgroundColor: ...,
  sections: [/* tv picker, cast, trailers, recommendations */],
)
```

- Section spacing: `DetailsTokens.sectionSpacing` — applied inside scroll page, not per screen.
- Recommendations: `MediaDetailsRecommendationsSection` + screen-specific `onMovieTap`.
- Torrent sources overlay: `TorrentSourcesPanel` + filters/tiles; screen wires chip `onChipTap` to existing handlers.

## Hero overview slots

- Home desktop uses a **fixed-height** overview slot (`ShellTokens.heroOverviewSlotHeightDesktop`).
- `HeroOverviewText` must respect `constraints.hasBoundedHeight` — never let synopsis + Read More overflow the slot.

## Adding a new shared widget

1. Pick a folder from the map above (`hero/`, `media_details/`, `chrome/`, …) — not a flat root file.
2. Export from barrel if in `media_details/`.
3. Use `ShellTokens` / `DetailsTokens` + `ForjaShellColors` + design buttons — no inline style copies from old god files.
4. Update RFC-026 component row if part of the media-details UX arc.

Do **not** put app-shell or kit-host orchestration under `components/` leaf folders. App frame → `lib/shell/`. Hub tab host → `shared/foundation/blocks/shell/`.

## Do not

- Clone cast/crew UI — use `MediaDetailsCastSection` only.
- Reintroduce `media_details_metadata_sections.dart` (deleted; superseded).
- Put torrent search / Stremio fetch logic inside `torrent_source_tiles.dart`.
